      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly use the term “conventional level” or define it; it contrasts “a lower level of moral reasoning” with “the post-conventional level,” so the requested mapping from “conventional level” to “lower level” is not directly supported.",
        "The definition claims judging “mainly by following laws, rules, and social order,” but the packet only states “adherence to laws and rules (maintaining norms schema)” and does not mention “social order.”",
        "The definition’s contrast (“maintaining norms rather than on broader shared principles”) is broadly consistent with the packet, but because the term/sense and the “social order” component are not supported, the definition cannot be accepted as written."
